          </button>
          <div class="faq-answer max-h-0 overflow-hidden transition-all duration-300 ease-in-out px-4 text-xs text-[#A3A3A3] leading-relaxed">
            <p class="pb-4">Yes. CipherPDF provides conversion utilities for supported document and image formats, including PDF, Word, Excel, CSV, text and images.</p>
